   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support small vulnerable farmers from winter wave</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to support 100 small farmers from rural municipalities of Bogota affected by the winter wave by providing  technical support  to recover and sale their crops. With this support, farmers would improve their economic and nutritional means, while at the same time reducing agricultural waste surpluses.</narrative>
